    "main": "Sofía and Luis lay out their separate clothes on two clearly identified chairs. Introduce shirt/pants, then a separate dress/skirt comparison. Do not assume all alternatives belong to one outfit.",
    "layer": "The same pair compare jackets, then hats. A color contrast uses the same garment and composition with only color changed.",
    "feet": "Sofía’s socks and shoes appear as complete pairs, first separately and then with their owner. Do not hide one shoe or sock.",
    "belong": "Finish by matching each established person with their visible belongings; a pointing speaker identifies ownership."
